lity.\n**What would change my vote:** Credible evidence that C\u2019s communication issues have caused serious crew conflicts or safety incidents; or convincing data that B\u2019s stress resilience and technical competence consistently outweigh his interpersonal flaws; or confirmation that D is reliably dependable under stress and his temperament does not impair crew cooperation.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
